\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.2}{\ignorespaces OpenStreetMap road network visualization integrated into the dashboard. The system extracts road topology via Overpass API and parses it into a navigable adjacency list. Node positions represent intersections and waypoints; edge connectivity shows the walkable street network. The dashboard renders this topology with color-coded congestion levels overlaid on the street segments, enabling operators to visualize both the static network structure and dynamic flow conditions simultaneously.}}{3}{figure.1.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:road_network}{{1.2}{3}{OpenStreetMap road network visualization integrated into the dashboard. The system extracts road topology via Overpass API and parses it into a navigable adjacency list. Node positions represent intersections and waypoints; edge connectivity shows the walkable street network. The dashboard renders this topology with color-coded congestion levels overlaid on the street segments, enabling operators to visualize both the static network structure and dynamic flow conditions simultaneously}{figure.1.2}{}}
